5.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/90-5.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsiri ya Al-Balad 90:5 — kwa mujibu wa Ibn Taymiyyah na Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Ati anadhani hapana yeyote ataye muweza?\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/sw/\">Mwanzo</a> › <a href=\"/sw/surah/90.html\">Sura Al-Balad</a> › Aya 5</nav><h1>Tafsiri ya Sura Al-Balad 90:5</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿أَيَحْسَبُ أَن لَّن يَقْدِرَ عَلَيْهِ أَحَدٌ﴾</p><section><h3>Tafsiri ya maana</h3><p class=\"tr\">Ati anadhani hapana yeyote ataye muweza?</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Swahili Translation - Ali Mohsin Al-Barwani — v1.0.1 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Maneno ya maimamu wawili yametolewa kwa Kiarabu asilia, neno kwa neno, pamoja na marejeo.</p><section><h2>Sheikh al-Islam Ibn Taymiyyah</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">والقدرة على الأعيان جاءت في مثل قوله: {ولقد خلقنا الإنسان} {أيحسب أن لن يقدر عليه أحد}<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 8/11</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=sw#s90a5\">Fungua katika tafsiri shirikishi (maandiko kamili)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/sw/ayah/90-4.html\">Aya iliyotangulia (90:4)</a><a href=\"/sw/ayah/90-7.html\">Aya inayofuata (90:7)<